SUMMARY:CHUCK PROPHET (USA) / OUR MAN IN THE FIELD (UK) (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION:Doors: 19:30\, Our Man In The Field: 20:00\, Chuck Prophet: 21:00   CHUCK PROPHET Chuck Prophet’s streak of more than a dozen critically acclaimed solo records stretches all the way back to 1990\, when the California native first shifted focus from his tenure with pioneering neo-psych band Green on Red to working under his own name. Since then\, his songs have appeared in a slew of films and television shows\, and his work has been covered by Bruce Springsteen\, Solomon Burke\, Heart\, and a host of others. Rolling Stone dubbed him a “streetwise city kid with an eye for the country\,” while Uncut proclaimed him a “renaissance-rocker\,” and NPR declared that “no one can turn tales from the outer limits into catchy songs quite like Prophet does.”   His latest album ‘Wake The Dead’ topped the US Americana charts for two weeks and was followed by his biggest ever European tour with over sixteen sold out shows. He is now set to return for a short November run performing as a stripped down three piece across Europe and the UK with upright bass and drums digging deep back into his catalogue for some very unique shows. https://chuckprophet.com/    OUR MAN IN THE FIELD  https://omitf.com/
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6676
